WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.982
Humans are primates.

2
00:00:01.982 --> 00:00:03.197
So what do we share

3
00:00:03.197 --> 00:00:05.068
with monkeys and apes?

4
00:00:05.392 --> 00:00:07.204
Forward-facing eyes with depth and

5
00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:08.109
colour vision.

6
00:00:08.109 --> 00:00:10.525
Grasping hands with opposable thumbs.

7
00:00:10.525 --> 00:00:11.536
Large brains,

8
00:00:11.536 --> 00:00:12.732
long childhoods,

9
00:00:12.732 --> 00:00:14.772
and rich social lives.

10
00:00:15.104 --> 00:00:16.636
What sets hominins apart is

11
00:00:16.636 --> 00:00:17.955
walking upright,

12
00:00:17.955 --> 00:00:18.791
and later,

13
00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:20.155
very large brains,

14
00:00:20.155 --> 00:00:22.102
culture and language.

15
00:00:22.449 --> 00:00:24.334
The order splits into prosimians,

16
00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.087
like lemurs and lorises,

17
00:00:26.087 --> 00:00:27.951
and anthropoids: monkeys,

18
00:00:27.951 --> 00:00:29.584
apes and humans.

19
00:00:29.921 --> 00:00:31.092
Your turn.

20
00:00:31.092 --> 00:00:33.572
Which trait separates hominins?
